  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 537.04 Service Limits. The individual services which compromise a RHC and a FQHC visit shall be subject to the applicable limits, in accordance with He-W 530.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #4884, eff 8-1-90, EXPIRED: 8-1-96\n\nNew. #6725, eff 4-1-98, EXPIRED: 4-1-06",
